  hintAudioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8c19abc5a51973444b12694d10a97584, type: 3}
  hintText: "July 4th Hello, my boy! I imagine you were quite shocked at how tidy
    and intact the room looked when you arrived\u2014especially considering it fell
    out of the sky. But don\u2019t let that fool you. You should take a look at the
    frames on the walls, make sure they\u2019re properly aligned. Sometimes, things
    aren\u2019t as steady as they seem. "
